<title>POLAND: Poland keeps 3-yr bond min price flat at 98.90.</title>
<headline>Poland keeps 3-yr bond min price flat at 98.90.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry kept the minimum price of its floating interest three-year bonds flat at 98.90 on Tuesday from the last tender in January, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>It said the average price fell to 99.00 from 99.42.</p>
<p>The ministry accepted 154 million zlotys worth of bids totalling 468.1 million zlotys against a 700 million zloty offer.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
